+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, including development builds; it is not disabled anywhere. Tests and local development that need a certificate without relying on an external authority use self-signed certificates, so the verification code path is exercised the same way in every environment.
